      <strong>Steps 1–3: Drag the baseball bat on the ground to the girl</strong>
      <p>Drag the baseball bat on the ground to the girl; then Drag the doll to the girl; then Drag the track in the bottom right corner to the girl</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 2</span>
      <strong>Steps 4–6: Drag the phone stand in front of the statue to the girl</strong>
      <p>Drag the phone stand in front of the statue to the girl; then Drag the unicycle inside the billboard to the girl; then Drag the billboard to the girl</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 3</span>
      <strong>Steps 7–9: Drag the vine outside the box to the girl</strong>
      <p>Drag the vine outside the box to the girl; then Drag the chain on the pillar to the girl; then Swipe up on the trash can</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 4</span>
      <strong>Steps 10–11: Drag the iron rod inside to the girl</strong>
      <p>Drag the iron rod inside to the girl; then Drag the headphones from the girl's head to her</p>
    </div>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
   
    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 5?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the baseball bat on the ground to the girl; 2) Drag the doll to the girl; 3) Drag the track in the bottom right corner to the girl; 4) Drag the phone stand in front of the statue to the girl; 5) Drag the unicycle inside the billboard to the girl; 6) Drag the billboard to the girl; 7) Drag the vine outside the box to the girl; 8) Drag the chain on the pillar to the girl; 9) Swipe up on the trash can; 10) Drag the iron rod inside to the girl; 11) Drag the headphones from the girl's head to her</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 5?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3 mixes taps, drags and swipes freely. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to — most moves in this game are drags.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is this Level 5 walkthrough up to date?</summary><p>Yes — the step order matches the current version of Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind. Older videos and sites may use different level numbers, because the developer has inserted new levels over time and shifted the numbering.</p></details>

